0.5%, were adjusted to sum to 100%. These percentages were multiplied times a pollen sum of 200 to back calculate the counts. The actual pollen sums were not indicated on the pollen diagram or in the text."}},"chronologies":{"chronologies":[{"chronology":{"chronology":{"notes":"Age model is based on correlation with Ageröds Mosse, which is immediatly adjacent to Rönneholms Mosse. The sediment stratigraphic date is the \"gränshorisont\" identified at Rönneholms Mosse at 45 cm, which correlates with the boundary between lilthologic units A and B at 190 cm at Ageröds Mosse. The age of this horizion is based on the MADCAP age model from Ageröds Mosse.\r\n\r\nBacon command line:\r\nBacon(\"RONNHOLA\",thick=5,acc.mean=60,d.max=80,depths.file=TRUE)\r\n\r\nBacon settings file:\r\n0 #d.min\r\n80 #d.max\r\n1 #d.by\r\n1 #depths.file\r\nNA #slump\r\n60 #acc.mean\r\n1.5 #acc.shape\r\n0.7 #mem.mean\r\n4 #mem.strength\r\nNA #hiatus.depths\r\n1000 #hiatus.mean\r\n1 #hiatus.shape\r\n0 #BCAD\r\n1 #cc\r\n0 #postbomb\r\nIntCal13 #cc1\r\nMarine13 #cc2\r\nSHCal13 #cc3\r\nConstCal #cc4\r\ncm #unit\r\n0 #normal\r\n3 #t.a\r\n4 #t.b\r\n0 #d.R\r\n0 #d.STD\r\n0.95 #prob","contact":[{"contactid":44,"givenname":"Eric Christopher","familyname":"Grimm","contactname":"Grimm, Eric Christopher","leadinginitial":"E.C."}],"agemodel":"Bacon","agerange":{"ageboundolder":4330,"ageboundyounger":930},"isdefault":true,"dateprepared":"2019-06-19","modelagetype":"Calibrated radiocarbon years BP","chronologyname":"EPD 1"},"chronologyid":29020,"chroncontrols":[{"depth":45,"geochron":{},"thickness":5,"agelimitolder":2825,"chroncontrolid":91441,"agelimityounger":2575,"chroncontrolage":2700,"chroncontroltype":"Sediment stratigraphic"},{"depth":0,"geochron":{},"thickness":1,"agelimitolder":65,"chroncontrolid":91440,"agelimityounger":35,"chroncontrolage":50,"chroncontroltype":"Core top"}]}}]}}}],"message":"Retrieved all tables"}